Subject: Mirant Proposed Study of the Midwest--Companies interested in
sponsoring the study. 


As I had mentioned to the Coalition last week,  Mirant is proceeding with
preparing a study evaluating the RTO and Market inefficiencies in the
Midwest. This study is a followon to the study that was sponsored by Mirant
for the Northeast.


I have received indications from the following Companies that they have an
interest in sponsoring the study with Mirant.   

Mirant;   AES; Constellation;  DENA; Edison Mission; Calpine; Reliant; NRG
Energy, PSEG; NEG/PGE; 


For those companies that I have not listed,  please let me know if your
company has an interest in the study sponsorship.   We are now attempting to
schedule a meeting in Washington next week to review proposed scope,
sponsorship, utilization and other issues related to the study.


